        "original_id": "aa9cc5e0-0a78-5ff6-b48d-ccbadebda5ad",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Moon Embracing the Sun\n- People: Kim Soo-hyun, Han Ga-in, Jung Il-woo, Kim Min-seo\n- Organizations: MBC\n- Topics: South Korean television dramas, South Korean actors\n\nFacts:\n- Kim Soo-hyun was born on February 16, 1988, and he is a South Korean actor.\n- Kim Soo-hyun is best known for roles in the television dramas \"Dream High\" (2011), \"Moon Embracing the Sun\" (2012), \"My Love from the Star\" (2013), and \"The Producers\" (2015).\n- Kim Soo-hyun is also known for roles in the films \"The Thieves\" (2012), \"Secretly, Greatly\" (2013), and \"Real\" (2017).\n- \"Moon Embracing the Sun,\" also known as \"The Moon That Embraces the Sun\" or \"The Sun and the Moon,\" is a 2012 South Korean television drama series.\n- \"Moon Embracing the Sun\" stars Kim Soo-hyun, Han Ga-in, Jung Il-woo, and Kim Min-seo.\n- \"Moon Embracing the Sun\" aired on MBC from January 4 to March 15, 2012, on Wednesdays and Thursdays at 21:55 for 20 episodes.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
